.Dd October 17, 2026
.Dt PATINA-WALLPAPER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm patina-wallpaper
.Nd the Patina desktop's wallpaper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
draws the wallpaper behind every window, on every screen: the image named
by
.Ic wallpaper
in the bar's config, scaled to fill the screen, or without one the Sector
F Labs flask and name in the colours of the bar's skin.
It watches the config, and redraws when the wallpaper or the skin change.
.Pp
Clicks pass through it to the compositor, which opens
.Xr patina-menu 1
on a right click.
.Pp
.Xr patina-compositor 1
starts it first, before the bar, and starts it again whenever it exits.
The wallpaper is chosen in
.Xr patina-settings 1 ,
from
.Pa ~/Pictures/Wallpapers
and the system's backgrounds.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , -help
Print a short usage message.
.It Fl V , -version
Print the version.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.config/patina-bar/config.toml
.Ic wallpaper ,
an image file or empty for the default, and
.Ic skin .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr patina-bar 1 ,
.Xr patina-settings 1 ,
.Xr patina-desktop 7
